# Product Baseline Status

Dashboard for the **predefined product foundation** under `01-product/`,
`02-business/`, `03-technical/`, `05-releases/`. Read by every slice at
Clarify to decide whether to proceed with full baseline or fly-blind.

This file is a **status table**, not a workflow doc. It updates whenever a
Product Foundation slice closes or a Product Delta lands.

## Status Values

| Value | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `not_started` | Folder is empty or only has skeleton README. Slices touching it fly-blind. |
| `seeded` | Some content exists but only enough for AI to read structure. Slices touching it fly-blind. |
| `partial` | Content covers some areas; **specify which area is empty** in the Notes column. Slices touching empty areas fly-blind. |
| `complete` | All planned areas covered for current product scope. Slices touching it consume the baseline normally. |

A slice that consumes a folder marked `not_started`, `seeded`, or `partial-with-empty-target-area`
must include a **Baseline-pending Acknowledgment** in its plan and flag every
Product Delta against that folder as `proposed-against-no-baseline`.

